  "note": "Seed for Brand.settings.planner of SolarMeister (German solar shop, Europe/Berlin). Built 2026-11-05 from the tags on its ready assets. Settings only: posts per day per network are set on Review (0 = skipped). All copy is German (language de). Posts 7 days a week, 08:00-20:00 Berlin with 70% between 10:00 and 16:00. Used by Review -> Plan when the brand has no planner block. Load by hand with: {\"action\":\"configure-planner-brand\",\"brandSlug\":\"solarmeister\",\"settings\":<settings>,\"accounts\":[]}",
